    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλ-ασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a black</i> or <i>livid spot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				11
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				86
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Liq.</u>
				4
			</span></i> (sg.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>black hair-dye</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.Com.
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
